t(19, 75, """Allah knows why I remembered you, our sister .. Perhaps you need these words, and Allah knows best .. But I know the time has not yet come, our sister, if you are following .. Some 12 to 14 years ago, when you contacted me, this picture in the post was your vision. If you have seen the picture, you will know who is speaking to you here now, the one you got in touch with years ago and to whom you explained what had befallen you .. May Allah help you and keep you firm in your great affliction .. Tribes that have settled in you .. You have now reached more than thirty years of pain and ache .. If you are watching this post, know that the address of your house and your street in your country clings to me more than my passport .. My passport might perhaps get lost, but the paper with your address never gets lost .. The stations, the journeys and the crises multiply .. The exiles follow one another, each with its story .. and its ordeal .. But that paper never gets lost .. Many papers get lost .. many things .. many belongings .. But .. but .. the one with your address on it does not get lost .. does not get lost .. never gets lost .. Whenever I settle at a station, the paper appears .. as though it looks at me and says: I am here, I never get lost .. I am here with you among your papers, of which so many were lost at your stations .. But I in particular do not get lost!! As though it speaks and says: This woman who has grown old and whose body has weakened, who went to many ruqyah healers in the Arabian Peninsula and they did not succeed in driving those tribes out of her body .. that woman is a trust .. This is a message to you, if you are reading .. so that you know that Allah Most High has power over all things, and perhaps it will steady you in the moments of weakness that are logical and conceivable for a case like yours .. I do not know why I remembered you this night .. Allah Most High alone knows .. Perhaps you need steadying .. And this is so that we, Muslim men and women, know that Allah has power over all things, that Allah encompasses all things, and that Allah is the Subduer above all His creatures, whether they will it or refuse!

In the picture: drawing out thick black smoke from the forehead without touching the forehead .. drawing it out using the palm of the hand""")

